  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He is the first figure to walk from the phantom River of Time above Calamity Luck Altar, roaring exploding lightning that forces Zhang Fei Xiong’s giant bear back and bloodies its face. He laughs maniacally at Heavenly Court attackers who do not know his name and uses exploding lightning so they fly out and lose consciousness. Fairy Zi Wei places him with Hei Fan and Liu Liu Liu as rank eight experts of the Northern Plains Huang Jin tribes.",
      "chapters": [
        1717
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "char_zhang_fei_xiong",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_hei_fan",
        "char_liu_liu_liu",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As a Northern Plains Gu Immortal he laughs that twilight lightning is not easy to deal with and that he has killed many transformation path Gu Immortals. Narration states he cultivates lightning path solely, was once a brutal slaughterer who roamed Northern Plains’ Gu Immortal world unhindered, and that when he was first supreme elder of Nu Er tribe it became the number one force of Northern Plains without doubt. A red-light Heavenly Court fighter (Zhu Que Er) covers him in flames and forces him off Zhang Fei Xiong; he has strong lightning path killer moves but cannot land an attack on her.",
      "chapters": [
        1718
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "twilight-lightning-and-nu-er-tribe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_nu_er_tribe",
        "char_zhu_que_er"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Zhu Que Er’s eight red lights he forms a spherical lightning web shield. He then pulls his beard; strands shoot out, turn into lightning spears, and form a tight formation toward her.",
      "chapters": [
        1719
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beard-lightning-spears",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Longevity Heaven activates call of the ancient from Calamity Luck Altar, the tall-bodied Nu Er Bao Xiong walks from the phantom River of Time laughing and offering explosive lightning bolts.",
      "chapters": [
        1926
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "call-of-the-ancient-again",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He roars and uses an immortal killer move of exploding lightning balls that blocks Flesh Whip Immortal and Zhang Fei Xiong from Calamity Luck Altar. He later strikes Duke Long first with hundreds of lightning balls, then throws a dark deep lightning ball like a meteor; Duke Long deals with that powerful killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        1927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blocking-flesh-whip-immortal",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_flesh_whip_immortal",
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    }
  ],
